{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/07ec61084e41300fd44eeb124c06adad.avif?t=1773131868\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras_big/07ec61084e41300fd44eeb124c06adad.avif?t=1773131868 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into a relaxing, color-filled escape with Color-A-Cube.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This free immersive coloring experience lets you color voxel models cube by cube, with crisp clicks, pops, and sparkly effects that make each step feel rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to pick up, hard to put down.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a growing library of unique models, with new creations to color and collect every month.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/8795359a44f1916dc12d8f5ec6b41e87.poster.avif?t=1773131868\" width=1170 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/8795359a44f1916dc12d8f5ec6b41e87.webm?t=1773131868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/8795359a44f1916dc12d8f5ec6b41e87.mp4?t=1773131868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/3a7fec81d2f5b9d837a6fc63d0c235a6.avif?t=1773131868\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras_big/3a7fec81d2f5b9d837a6fc63d0c235a6.avif?t=1773131868 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with <strong>18 unique models</strong> to color for free, plus new <strong>free content added every month</strong>, along with seasonal surprises and <strong>crossover events</strong> that keep the world of Color-A-Cube fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Want more?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your collection with affordable themed packs: fantasy, mythology, animals, landmarks, and more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/a0e8337a07e925479c0daee79a272345.avif?t=1773131868\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras_big/a0e8337a07e925479c0daee79a272345.avif?t=1773131868 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and color your way through an expanding world of voxel art, each set featuring unique sounds and bursts of particles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >that make every voxel feel alive beneath your brush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each handcrafted model holds surprises waiting to be revealed, one cube at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/315893ddfc9e004680c5e3840db1b477.avif?t=1773131868\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras_big/315893ddfc9e004680c5e3840db1b477.avif?t=1773131868 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366710/extras/02c3f0097172414202bb4a00239f6ed7.poster.a